      <profiles>
        <profile name="Objective Secured" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="1164-3aff-c9a6-718d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If you control an objective marker at the end of your Command phase and this unit is within range of that objective marker, that objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Hail of Bolts" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="4207-56a0-b930-84bd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, when this unit is selected to shoot, select up to one visible enemy unit. While making those attacks, this unit’s Bolt Rifle attacks that targeted that enemy unit have +2 A.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
