                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Adeptus Astartes Mounted model only. If the bearer&apos;s unit is in Strategic Reserves, for the purposes of setting up that unit on the battlefield, treat the current battle round as being one higher than it actually is</characteristic>
