              <profiles>
                <profile name="Master of Machine War" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="d4fe-9138-66d1-3a49">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. In your Command phase, select one ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE model within 6&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, that VEHICLE is eligible to shoot even if it Fell Back or Advanced this turn.</characteristic>
