                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">TECHMARINE model only. In your Command phase, select one ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE model within 6&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, weapons equipped by that VEHICLE model have the [LETHAL HITS] ability.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
