                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Deathwing^^** model only. Melee weapons equipped by the bearer have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability, and each time the bearer makes a melee attack, if it is within range of your Vowed objective marker, a Critical Hit is scored on an unmodified Hit roll of 5+.</characteristic>
