                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Adeptus Astartes Jump Pack model only. In the Battle-shock step of your opponent&apos;s Command phase, each enemy unit (excluding Monsters and Vehicles) within Engagement Range of the bearer must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
