                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Death Company model only. If the bearer is destroyed, until the end of your next turn, each time a friendly Death Company model make an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll.</characteristic>
