                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">SPACE WOLVES model only. In your Command phase, select one friendly SPACE WOLVES unit within 9&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, teeth and claws and Tyrnak and Fenrir weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability.</characteristic>
