                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. After both players have deployed their armies, select up to three THUNDERWOLF CAVALRY, WULFEN and/or BLOOD CLAWS units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves if you wish, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves</characteristic>
