                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Adeptus Astartes^^** model only. Add 2 the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the bearer. Each time a melee attack made by the bearer is allocated to an enemy model, if the bearer disembarked from a **^^Transport^^** this turn, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
