                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. Each time the bearer&apos;s unit declares a charge, if an enemy unit takes a Battle-shock test as a result of the Shock and Awe detachment rule, subtract 1 from that Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
