                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. At the start of your shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to the bearer. Until the end of the phase, models in that unit cannot have the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
