                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Adeptus Astartes model only. While an enemy unit (excluding Monsters and Vehicles) is within 6&quot; of
the bearer, each time that unit fails a Battle‑shock test, one model in that unit is destroyed (chosen by
its controlling player). Once per battle, when such an enemy unit fails a Battle‑shock test, you can choose for D3 models in that unit to be destroyed in this way instead.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink targetId="6226-9b9b-107a-9ada" id="b1a9-14cf-3003-034c" primary="false" name="Enhancement"/>
