                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Adeptus Astartes model only. Improve the Strength and Armour Penetration characteristics of the bearer’s melee weapons by 1. Each time the bearer ends a Charge move, until the end of the turn, improve the Strength and Armour Penetration characteristics of the bearer’s melee weapons by 2 instead.</characteristic>
