                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the bearer’s unit makes a Fall Back move, select one of the following to apply to that unit until the end of the turn: 
- That unit is eligible to perform an Action in a turn in which it Fell Back. 
- That unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
