                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After both players have deployed their armies, select up to three ^^**Adeptus Astartes**^^ units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
