              <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Shock Deployment&quot; sustained=1 when=ranged conditional</comment>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Shock Deployment" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="d985-3821-4299-309a">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Adeptus Astartes Terminator or Gravis model only. In your Shooting phase, each time the bearer’s unit is selected to shoot, if it disembarked from a Transport this turn, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
                  <conditionGroups>
