                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the start of the battle round, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the turn, this model has the following ability:

**Wise Orator (Aura):** Each time a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** unit within 6&quot; of this model makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Wound roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
