                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the start of any phase, the bearer can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, the bearer has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against mortal wounds and a 2+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
