              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Sanguinary Priest^^** model only. Once per battle, when this model&apos;s unit is select to fight, you can use this ability. If you do, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapon equipped by models in that unit.</characteristic>
