                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Chaplain^^** model only. During the Declare Battle Formations step, if this model is attached to a **^^Death Company^^** unit, select one of the **^^Death Company^^** Battle Scars; until the end of the battle, that unit has that Battle Scar in addition to any others it has.</characteristic>
