                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the bearer makes an attack that targets a **^^Monster^^** or **^^Vehicle^^** unit, add 1 to the Wound roll and add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
