                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that unit&apos;s Move characteristic, and you can ignore any or all modifiers to Advance and Charge rolls made for it.</characteristic>
