              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Add 1 to Charge rolls made for the bearer&apos;s unit. Each time the bearer&apos;s unit is selected to fight, if that unit made a Charge move this turn, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit.</characteristic>
