                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Chaplain^^** model only. You can re-roll Battle-shock tests taken for the bearer&apos;s unit. In addition, in the Select Crusade Blessings step, roll one D6, add 2 to the result if you are the Underdog: on a 6+, you can use one additional Crusade Blessing this battle (even if you are not the Underdog).</characteristic>
