              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">- Each time you lose a battle while this model is part of your Crusade Army, make a note of your opponent&apos;s Faction keyword on this model&apos;s Crusade Card. That keyword is one of this model&apos;s Learned Foes.
- At the start of the first battle round, if this model is your **^^Warlord^^** and your opponent&apos;s Faction keyword matches one of this model&apos;s Learned Foes, roll one D6: on a 2+, you gain 1CP.</characteristic>
