                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Psyker^^** model only. Add 1 to the Strength and Damage characteristics of **[PSYCHIC]** weapons the bearer is equipped with.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
